CorrodeOS
=========

A capability-based microkernel for x86_64, written from scratch in Rust.

These files came from the boot medium, packed when the system was built.
They are read-only: nothing on this machine can change them, because no
program holds a capability that would.

Try:
    ls /docs
    cat /docs/capabilities.txt
    grep -n grant /docs/*.txt
    caps
